Title: The Shed
Author: Test

INT. KOVAČ HOUSE - KITCHEN - DAY #1#

= Anna and Tom wait out the rain.

Anna makes tea. Rain on the window.

ANNA
Is it still raining?

TOM (O.S.)
Like the end of the world.

ANNA
Then we stay in.

EXT. GARDEN - NIGHT #1A# [[red]]

Tom runs to the shed.

TOM
Wait for me!

ANNIE (CONT'D)
I always do.

